7.50.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) flat grill - general surfaces on underside (grease);
B) fryers - inside lower compartments, general surfaces on undersides, & wheels (grease/food debris);
C) grill line cooler - bottom inside (food crumbs);  and
D) Monster cooler - bottom inside and outer ledge (food splash).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
